+#### .pruneExpired()
+
+Remove all currently visible items whose expiration time has passed, using the `onEviction` callback for each removed logical key.
+
+Returns the number of logical keys removed. It does not promote or reorder live entries. A current item shadows an old item with the same key, so an expired old value is ignored while the current value is live. If the current value expires, its shadowed old value is removed without a second callback and is not resurrected.
+
 #### .resize(maxSize)
 
 Update the `maxSize`, discarding items as necessary. Insertion order is mostly preserved, though this is not a strong guarantee.
